      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so frustrating because it feels like the data is just... disappearing or getting lost somewhere in the middle. like it's not even traveling in a straight line. why does it feel so inconsistent? like it's hitting some places fine but then completely bypassing others for no reason?",
